	(text "ADP160 LDO: powers the PROUT rail (PIC, MS5611, MAS6240) from the Kobo battery (BATT+).\nEN is driven by KOBO_EN from the Kobo connector. R3 (33k) holds EN low when KOBO_EN is not driven, so the board is off.\nC1 / C2: 1 µF ceramic on VIN / VOUT, as required by the ADP160 datasheet.\nThe ADP160 is a fixed-output part (15 options, 1.2 V to 4.2 V): check the exact variant in the BOM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
